## Testing Checklist

- [ ] Request reset for existing email - email sent
- [ ] Request reset for non-existing email - generic message (no information leak)
- [ ] Token expires after 1 hour
- [ ] Token can only be used once
- [ ] Password meets complexity requirements (8+ characters)
- [ ] Password confirmation validation
- [ ] System user reset works (CRM/CMS)
- [ ] Student reset works (Student Portal)
- [ ] Email links work correctly
- [ ] Rate limiting prevents abuse (3 requests/minute)

## Security Considerations

✅ Generic messages prevent email enumeration
✅ Tokens expire after 1 hour
✅ Tokens are single-use
✅ Rate limiting on reset endpoints
✅ Passwords hashed with bcrypt (12 rounds)
✅ HTTPS required in production
✅ Email links use secure tokens (32 bytes random)

