## 7. Migration Checklist (For Future Components)

When migrating a component from `useState` + `localStorage` to zustand:

- [ ] Identify all `useState` calls related to the state being migrated
- [ ] Identify all direct `localStorage.getItem/setItem` calls
- [ ] Create the zustand store with the combined state shape
- [ ] Create selector hooks for the state slices used by components
- [ ] Replace `useState` calls with zustand selectors
- [ ] Remove all direct `localStorage` calls (persist middleware handles this)
- [ ] Remove any `useEffect` that syncs state to `localStorage`
- [ ] Test that page refresh preserves auth state (for persisted stores)
- [ ] Test that logout clears all persisted state
- [ ] Verify no sensitive data is written to `localStorage` (check DevTools > Application > Local Storage)

